+// settings_press — the 7.3 settings chip/panel press hit-test, shared by the
+// app (settings_click delegates) AND the parity harness (parity_settings_press_effect
+// delegates) — ONE implementation (the popover_demolish_hit precedent; Perkins
+// r3 blocker 4: the parity twin re-implemented the hit-test and modeled no
